  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM &#x2013; Multi Country Humanitarian Assistance &#x2013; CAP 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan has had various challenges in managing man-made and disasters due to natural hazards over the years due to political and socio-economic instability. Protracted and new displacement continue in Sudan due to decades of conflict and natural disasters. In response to current health situation, and considering the identified needs and vulnerabilities, the proposed action aims to provide immediate emergency response support to vulnerable mobile populations, including internally displaced persons (IDPs), returnees, and refugees through: Providing site management support to targeted gathering sites; Distributing of emergency shelter and non-food items (ES/NFI); Increasing access to timely and primary health services; and Increasing access to safe and clean water.</narrative>
  </description>
